  "description": "Beargrease Eagle 70 is a versatile fat tire bike designed for winter ultras, hot laps on snowy singletrack, and any other all-terrain, all-conditions rides you can cook up. The 27.5 x 4.5\" tires grant you all the float and traction you need to traverse snow, sand, or slick trails. Trail bike geometry and a dropper post keep you stable and in-control on snowy singletrack, winter ultra courses, or all-terrain, all-conditions wandering. The 6061-T6 aluminum frame is stiff for efficient pedaling and comes loaded with rack, cargo, and accessory mounts to keep you supplied on those out-all-day (or week) adventures. SRAM’s Eagle 70 groupset is a trusty companion, making it easy to shift pace from flowy groomed trails to grinding climbs.",
